  m_Name: Dialogue_SearchMouse
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueAsset
  lines:
  - speaker: 0
    text: Coffee delivered. Now I can finally do my actual job.
    useAction: 0
    onShownAction: []
    onAdvancedAction: []
    onShown:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onAdvanced:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - speaker: 0
    text: Where the hell is my mouse?
    useAction: 0
    onShownAction: []
    onAdvancedAction: []
    onShown:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onAdvanced:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - speaker: 0
    text: Hey, do you know where my mouse is?
    useAction: 0
    onShownAction: []
    onAdvancedAction: []
    onShown:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onAdvanced:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - speaker: 3
    text: Storage.
    useAction: 0
    onShownAction: []
    onAdvancedAction: []
    onShown:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onAdvanced:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - speaker: 0
    text: Where in storage?
    useAction: 0
    onShownAction: []
    onAdvancedAction: []
    onShown:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onAdvanced:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - speaker: 3
    text: Box marked M. M for mouse. Anything else?
    useAction: 0
    onShownAction: []
    onAdvancedAction: []
    onShown:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onAdvanced:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - speaker: 0
    text: No, thanks.
    useAction: 0
    onShownAction: []
    onAdvancedAction: []
    onShown:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onAdvanced:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - speaker: 0
    text: (thinking) Friendly place.
    useAction: 0
    onShownAction: []
    onAdvancedAction: []
    onShown:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onAdvanced:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - speaker: 3
    text: Storage. M. Mouse. Same answer. Stupidshit.
    useAction: 0
    onShownAction: []
    onAdvancedAction: []
    onShown:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onAdvanced:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - speaker: 0
    text: Did they forget to pay the electricity bill?
    useAction: 0
    onShownAction: []
    onAdvancedAction: []
    onShown:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onAdvanced:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - speaker: 0
    text: "Guess I\u2019ll have to get closer to read these labels."
    useAction: 0
    onShownAction: []
    onAdvancedAction: []
    onShown:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onAdvanced:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - speaker: 0
    text: M. That should be it.
    useAction: 0
    onShownAction: []
    onAdvancedAction: []
    onShown:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onAdvanced:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - speaker: 0
    text: A mug. Of course. M for mug.
    useAction: 0
    onShownAction: []
    onAdvancedAction: []
    onShown:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onAdvanced:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - speaker: 0
    text: "Apparently, the coffee tutorial isn\u2019t over."
    useAction: 0
    onShownAction: []
    onAdvancedAction: []
    onShown:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onAdvanced:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - speaker: 0
    text: A mirror.
    useAction: 0
    onShownAction: []
    onAdvancedAction: []
    onShown:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onAdvanced:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - speaker: 0
    text: Great. Now I can watch myself regret taking this job.
    useAction: 0
    onShownAction: []
    onAdvancedAction: []
    onShown:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onAdvanced:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - speaker: 0
    text: A keyboard? How is that M?
    useAction: 0
    onShownAction: []
    onAdvancedAction: []
    onShown:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onAdvanced:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - speaker: 0
    text: "There\u2019s a note. \u2018Might still work."
    useAction: 0
    onShownAction: []
    onAdvancedAction: []
    onShown:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onAdvanced:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - speaker: 0
    text: "That\u2019s not a fucking category."
    useAction: 0
    onShownAction: []
    onAdvancedAction: []
    onShown:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onAdvanced:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - speaker: 0
    text: Another box.
    useAction: 0
    onShownAction: []
    onAdvancedAction: []
    onShown:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onAdvanced:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - speaker: 0
    text: "More boxes.\u2019 Whoever labelled these thinks they\u2019re hilarious."
    useAction: 0
    onShownAction: []
    onAdvancedAction: []
    onShown:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onAdvanced:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - speaker: 0
    text: Empty.
    useAction: 0
    onShownAction: []
    onAdvancedAction: []
    onShown:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onAdvanced:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - speaker: 0
    text: "Should\u2019ve labelled this one \u2018Massive waste of time."
    useAction: 0
    onShownAction: []
    onAdvancedAction: []
    onShown:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onAdvanced:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - speaker: 0
    text: An actual mouse. Holy shit.
    useAction: 0
    onShownAction: []
    onAdvancedAction: []
    onShown:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onAdvanced:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - speaker: 0
    text: M for mouse. You did it. You labelled one correctly.
    useAction: 0
    onShownAction: []
    onAdvancedAction: []
    onShown:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onAdvanced:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - speaker: 0
    text: Alright. Back to my desk before someone asks for another coffee.
    useAction: 0
    onShownAction: []
    onAdvancedAction: []
    onShown:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onAdvanced:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - speaker: 0
    text: There. Mouse plugged in.
    useAction: 0
    onShownAction: []
    onAdvancedAction: []
    onShown:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onAdvanced:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - speaker: 0
    text: "Let\u2019s see what Grandma considers IT work."
    useAction: 0
    onShownAction: []
    onAdvancedAction: []
    onShown:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onAdvanced:
      m_PersistentCalls:
